TXT_OVL_HINTCOL_EDIT:
  db 48 00 69 00 6E 00 74 00 20 00 63 00 6F 00 6C 00 5B 00 74 00 5D 00 3A 00 20 00 20 00 25 00 30 00 36 00 58 00 00 00
TXT_OVL_PCOL_EDIT:
